== Convex Optimization for Engineers (EE502)

~~~
{Course information}
- *Code*: EE502 \M *Level*: Graduate \M *Semester*: Autumn 2025 \M *Credits*: 3
- *When*: Wednesday 14:00--16:00, Building B1, Room 405

*What you will learn:* convex sets and functions, duality, and how to recognise and solve the
optimization problems that appear in communications and signal processing.
~~~

~~~
{}{raw}
